sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as node-cron<br/>08:00, 12:00, 19:00 (TIMEZONE)
    participant S as sendMessage.js<br/>sendMessageToAllUsers()
    participant DB as MongoDB<br/>userinfos
    participant TW as Twilio SMS API
    actor P as User's phone

    CR->>S: Fixed message for breakfast, lunch or dinner
    S->>DB: find({ contactNumber exists and not null })
    DB-->>S: List of user profiles
    loop For each profile (one at a time)
        S->>S: Keep digits only, then add "+91"
        alt Twilio credentials missing
            S->>S: console.log("[MOCK] Would send ...")
        else Twilio client configured
            S->>TW: messages.create({ body, from, to })
            TW-->>P: SMS
        end
    end
    Note over S: One try/catch wraps the whole loop.<br/>A single failed send stops the remaining sends.
    Note over CR,TW: Also triggered by POST /send-messages, which has no authentication.
